@baseUrl = http://0.0.0.0:8080/api/v1
@token = 12345678

### ============================================================
### AkShare 模块接口
### ============================================================

### 获取 AK 模块信息与数据分类
GET {{baseUrl}}/ak/info
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 获取经济政策不确定性指数（EPU Index） - 默认 (China)
GET {{baseUrl}}/ak/article_epu_index?symbol=China
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 获取经济政策不确定性指数（EPU Index） - 美国 (USA)
GET {{baseUrl}}/ak/article_epu_index?symbol=USA
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 获取美联储 FRED-MD (月度) 宏观经济数据
GET {{baseUrl}}/ak/fred_md?date=2023-03
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 获取美联储 FRED-QD (季度) 宏观经济数据
GET {{baseUrl}}/ak/fred_qd?date=2023-03
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 获取 Oxford-Man 实际波动率数据
GET {{baseUrl}}/ak/article_oman_rv?symbol=FTSE&index=rk_th2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 获取 Oxford-Man 实际波动率简易数据
GET {{baseUrl}}/ak/article_oman_rv_short?symbol=FTSE
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 获取 Risk Lab 实际波动率数据
GET {{baseUrl}}/ak/article_rlab_rv?symbol=39693
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
